Package: com.vcamfullmay.tweak
Name: VcamFullMay
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Virtual camera replacement for video calls + camera uploads. Feeds frames from a user-chosen video file into AVCaptureSession so any app using the standard camera API sees the video instead of the live feed. Includes basic JB hide (filesystem path probes, URL scheme probes, dlopen of substrate dylibs). Audio (mic) stream is untouched.
Maintainer: Hieudeptrai04
Author: Hieudeptrai04
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit | mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
Tag: role::enduser
